(5654, '34010114', 'Paternity Leave', 'Credit Management Group (CMG)', 0, NULL, NULL, 'Full Day', '\\r\\nI would like to avail of my paternity leave so I can be with my wife and our newborn child during this very important moment in our lives. The arrival of our baby is a special occasion for our family, and I would like to personally be present to support my wife as she recovers from childbirth and to help her with the care and needs of our newborn.\\r\\n\\r\\nAs a husband and a father, I feel that my presence during these first few days is especially important. I want to be there for my wife, provide her with the support she needs, and share in the responsibilities of caring for our baby. More than anything, I would also like to spend meaningful time with my newborn and be present during the early days of our child\\\'s life.\\r\\n\\r\\nI sincerely hope for your kind consideration and approval of my paternity leave. This leave would mean a lot to me and my family, as it will allow me to fulfill my responsibilities as a husband and a father during this special and memorable time.\\r\\n\\r\\nThank you very much for your understanding and consideration.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe paternity leave will allow me to personally assist my family during this significant period while ensuring that my responsibilities at home are properly attended to. I will also make the necessary arrangements and turnover of my pending work to ensure minimal disruption to our department\\\'s operations during my absence.\\r\\n\\r\\nThank you for your kind consideration and approval of my paternity leave application.', NULL, '2026-10-22', NULL, '2026-10-30', '2026-10-06 08:41:22', 'Approved', '', '102010114', NULL, '2026-10-06 16:54:04', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
